Welcome to NetHack 5.0 for 68k Macintosh (System 7)

This is a revival of the classic Mac OS port, cross-compiled with
Retro68.  It runs on 68020-or-better Macs; tiles need a 4-bit or
8-bit color display (Quadra, or an SE/30 with a color card), and
text-mode play works fine in black and white.

Based on the original Macintosh port by Dean Luick, Kevin Hugo,
and Mark Modrall.

Bug reports, suggestions, comments, etc., should be e-mailed to the
Internet address nethack-bugs@nethack.org, or fill out our comment
form on the web at http://www.nethack.org.
